{"id":18010,"name":"Coffee County","slug":"coffee-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/coffee-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:22","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium bid","redemptionPeriod":"3 years","interestRate":"8%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"1st or 2nd Monday and Tuesday in April"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Revenue Commissioner, Ronald L. Burns"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Coffee County Courthouse"},{"label":"Registration Time","value":"9:30 a.m. CDT"},{"label":"Auction Start Time","value":"10:00 a.m. CDT"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"2W1LgJEzbwiSQrD8GYTx63VvUedmf0l4MuOqKCtahNIyopBFjsR95A\"><iframe title=\"Solid 8% Profit Each Year- Coffee County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8MXBrGWIihE?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span> \n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Solid-8%-Profit-Each-Year---Coffee-County,-Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\"><strong>Solid 8% Profit Each Year &#8211; Coffee County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you ready to make a solid 8% interest annually? Coffee County, Alabama, offers a fantastic opportunity through its tax lien sales. The county conducts these sales on the 1st or 2nd Monday and Tuesday in April, holding them at the courthouse in Enterprise on Monday and in Elba on Tuesday.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How It Works</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Attend the Auction</strong>: Arrive at the Coffee County Courthouse by 9:30 a.m. to register. The auction starts at 10:00 a.m.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bid on Properties</strong>: The county sells properties with unpaid taxes to the highest bidder.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Wait for Redemption</strong>: There is a 3-year redemption period. If the property owner redeems the property, you get back your investment plus the 8% interest. If not, you can begin foreclosure proceedings to take ownership.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Important Considerations:</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Due Diligence:</strong> Research properties thoroughly before bidding to understand any existing liens or issues.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Legal Advice:</strong> Consult with a legal professional to navigate the complexities of tax lien investing and foreclosure processes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Key-Information\">Key Information</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coffee-County-Alabama-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18018 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Coffee County Courthouse Alabama\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-headin